# Optional overrides. Copy to .env, uncomment a line and set a value to change its default.
# Defaults live in app/config.py (and in the Dockerfile for LLM_BASE_URL and DB_PATH).
# Leave a variable commented out to keep its default; an empty value is not the same as unset in Docker.

# "real" calls the LLM below; "fake" returns a fixed text (used by the smoke test and CI).
# LLM_BACKEND=

# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Ollama running on the host machine by default.
# LLM_BASE_URL=
# LLM_MODEL=
# API key for the endpoint. Not needed for Ollama. For a paid provider, set your own key here
# in .env; it is a secret and must never be committed.
# LLM_API_KEY=

# The date the app treats as "today" (YYYY-MM-DD). Unset means the system date.
# REFERENCE_DATE=

# SQLite file path. The Docker image sets it to a volume; only change it outside Docker.
# DB_PATH=
